<title>USA: IDT names Zumwalt to board.</title>
<headline>IDT names Zumwalt to board.</headline>
<dateline>HACKENSACK, N.J. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>IDT Corp Tuesday said former U.S. Chief of Naval Operations Admiral Elmo Russell Zumwalt Jr will join its board of directors in January.</p>
<p>IDT Corp offers integrated and bundled telephone, Internet access, and Internet telephony services.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
